Application that implements multi-call functionality, including the ability to execute multiple read-only function calls, aggregate results, and maintain a record of the block number and returned data for each call. Incorporate functions to retrieve the current block number, hash, timestamp, difficulty, gas limit, and coinbase. Ensure that the contract uses an array of structs to store call data and results, and utilize modular functions for better maintainability and scalability.

